* A more comprehensive Local Data Area for feature 27 testing
* Demonstrates groups, scalar fields, arrays, and data types
DEFINE DATA LOCAL
01 #EMPLOYEE-ID      (N8)
01 #EMPLOYEE-REC
   02 #EMP-NAME      (A50)
   02 #EMP-SALARY    (P9,2)
01 #DATES-ARRAY      (D/1:10)
01 #REDEF-FIELD      (A20)
   02 #REDEF-PART1   (A10)
   02 #REDEF-PART2   (A10)
END-DEFINE
